					<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>duobus in dextro crure secundum genum ben
					<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>vardulae ictu duobus in utroque brachio ex ensium
					<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>pplaga vivus, at non sene multa hoscium eric
					<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>insignium nece in hostium potestatem venit
					<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>se nunc accipe letiora. Biduo pest, equescri ductis
					<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cerlamine, neseri. Ledigneris illius vicur
